---
import { C2PA_FORMAT_GROUPS } from '../lib/c2pa/formats';
import type { Locale } from '../i18n/core';

interface Faq { question: string; answer: string }
interface Props { faqs: Faq[]; locale?: Locale }
const { faqs, locale = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh-CN';
---

<section class="c2pa-education" aria-labelledby="c2pa-about-title">
  <div class="c2pa-education-inner">
    <article class="c2pa-chapter">
      <span class="c2pa-chapter-index">01 / {zh ? '开放标准' : 'OPEN STANDARD'}</span>
      <h2 id="c2pa-about-title">{zh ? 'C2PA 是什么？' : 'What is C2PA?'}</h2>
      <div class="c2pa-chapter-copy">
        <p>{zh ? <><a href="https://c2pa.org/" rel="noreferrer">C2PA</a> 是记录数字内容来源和修改过程的开放技术标准。凭证可以说明创建文件的工具、之后的编辑操作，以及途中使用的素材。</> : <><a href="https://c2pa.org/" rel="noreferrer">C2PA</a> is an open technical standard for recording where digital content came from and how it changed. A credential can name the tool that created a file, the edits that followed, and the source material used along the way.</>}</p>
        <p>{zh ? '这段历史存在嵌入资源或与资源关联的签名清单中。本页只读取内嵌凭证，不会联系远程清单服务、信任列表或证书吊销服务。' : 'The history lives in a signed manifest embedded in, or associated with, the asset. This page reads embedded credentials only. It does not contact a remote manifest service, trust list, or certificate revocation service.'}</p>
        <p>{zh ? '很多真实文件没有 C2PA 数据。“什么都没找到”就只是没找到，不等于“造假”“AI”或“不可信”。' : 'Plenty of genuine files have no C2PA data. “Nothing found” means exactly that—not “fake,” “AI,” or “untrustworthy.”'}</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="c2pa-chapter">
      <span class="c2pa-chapter-index">02 / CONTENT CREDENTIALS</span>
      <h2>{zh ? '内容凭证与 C2PA' : 'Content Credentials and C2PA'}</h2>
      <div class="c2pa-chapter-copy">
        <p>{zh ? 'Content Credentials 是 C2PA 来源信息面向普通用户的名字，可以把它理解成数字文件的“成分表”。它能列出创建与编辑操作、素材、软件、日期和声明签名者。' : 'Content Credentials are the public-facing name for C2PA provenance—think of them as a nutrition label for a digital file. They can list creation and editing actions, ingredients, software, dates, and the signer responsible for the claim.'}</p>
        <p>{zh ? '与普通 EXIF 或 XMP 标签不同，声明经过加密签名并绑定到特定资源。修改受保护字节或凭证后，验证理应失败；删除凭证后，本地验证器也就无从检查。' : 'Unlike ordinary EXIF or XMP labels, the claim is cryptographically signed and bound to a specific asset. Change protected bytes or the credential and validation should fail. Remove the credential and this local verifier can no longer inspect it.'}</p>
        <p>{zh ? '有效结果证明凭证仍然绑定到当前文件，但不能证明每段话、声音或可见场景都是真的。' : 'A valid result proves that the credential still binds to this file. It does not prove that every statement, sound, or visible scene is true.'}</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="c2pa-supported" aria-labelledby="c2pa-supported-title">
      <header><span class="c2pa-chapter-index">03 / {zh ? '输入文件' : 'INPUTS'}</span><h2 id="c2pa-supported-title">{zh ? '支持的文件' : 'Supported files'}</h2><p>{zh ? '官方浏览器验证器启动前，会先检查真实文件签名。' : 'Real file signatures are checked before the official browser verifier starts.'}</p></header>
      <dl>{C2PA_FORMAT_GROUPS.map((group) => <div><dt>{zh ? ({ Images: '图片', Video: '视频', Audio: '音频', Document: '文档' }[group.label] ?? group.label) : group.label}</dt><dd>{group.formats}</dd></div>)}</dl>
      <aside><strong>50 MB</strong> {zh ? '用于图片与相机 RAW 文件；' : 'for images and camera RAW files.'} <strong>100 MB</strong> {zh ? '用于视频、音频和 PDF。' : 'for video, audio, and PDF.'}</aside>
    </section>

    <section class="c2pa-plain-faq" aria-labelledby="c2pa-faq-title">
      <header><span class="c2pa-chapter-index">{zh ? '别丢掉边界' : 'KEEP THE CAVEAT'}</span><h2 id="c2pa-faq-title">{zh ? '常见问题' : 'Frequently asked questions'}</h2></header>
      <div>{faqs.map((faq) => <article><h3>{faq.question}</h3><p>{faq.answer}</p></article>)}</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
